{
  "_about": "Converts Spinach's Distorted mode for DT3 (DTFree 1.0.10, a version of the whole game with its rooms, bosses and equipment changed; decompiled with gm8decompiler and split with gmksplit --preserve-ids all --allow-duplicate-ids tiles,instances) into a DT3+ mod folder. Its changes to the game's objects and to the game's scripts mods can replace are merged into DT3+'s versions by tools/modkit/mergemod.py (python mergemod.py init|update|check distorted/config.json) and finished by hand in merged/ (the mod's lines made to work at 60 and 120fps); its new objects and scripts are ported to DT3+'s 60fps code by hand in ported/. Then: python tools/modkit/convert.py tools/modkit/distorted/config.json, and python tools/modkit/validate.py <out> <project>. Its rooms are patches (patch_mode full: see convert.py, patch_room_full). 'vanilla' is the original game split with gmksplit: the DT3_v1_5_2_4_v120_gmksplit folder of this repository's commit fe70bd6d, unzipped into tools/modkit/_vanilla. Paths are this computer's.",
  "mod": "D:/Furige/dt3plus mod testing/DT3 Distorted/fAlteredInsanity_gmksplit",
  "vanilla": "../_vanilla/DT3_v1_5_2_4_v120_gmksplit",
  "project": "../../..",
  "out": "C:/Users/diplo/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/D--Furige-dt3-project-file-DT3-60FPS-plus/f5f2808c-879a-408c-a97d-96227aba9f1b/scratchpad/modout/Distorted",
